+/**
+ * close: sent to PRoot only for the netlink range, like recv_by_fd(), using the same statements
+ * (add_trace_recv). What close is traced for in PRoot: dropping a netlink socket from its tracking
+ * sets (those sockets live in the range, exit.c), auxv_fd (tracked in full PTRACE_SYSCALL mode, not
+ * through this filter) and the pipe shadow (pipe_shadow.c), which this gives up outside the range.
+ * Why: Xwayland closes GPU sync_file and dma-buf descriptors about 2,650 times a second and each one
+ * stopped PRoot (PROOT_STAT 2026-11-01: 159,017 of 397,962 stops a minute); none of them is a pipe or
+ * netlink socket. Compared on the device (2026-11-01): PRoot 23 % -> 8 % and stops -78 % while
+ * moving through Big Picture, no "Broken pipe" line, games ran. PROOT_FULL_CLOSE set: trace every
+ * close as before.
+ * close: recv_by_fd()처럼 netlink 구간만 PRoot로 보냄. 같은 문장을 씀(add_trace_recv). PRoot가 close를 추적하는
+ * 이유: netlink 소켓을 추적 목록에서 지우기(그 소켓은 구간 안에 있음, exit.c), auxv_fd(이 필터가 아니라 전체
+ * PTRACE_SYSCALL 방식으로 추적), pipe shadow(pipe_shadow.c). 구간 밖의 pipe shadow는 포기함. 이유: Xwayland가 GPU
+ * sync_file·dma-buf 디스크립터를 초당 약 2,650번 닫고 그때마다 PRoot가 멈췄음(PROOT_STAT 2026-11-01: 1분 정지
+ * 397,962번 중 159,017번). 그중 pipe나 netlink 소켓은 없음. 기기 비교(2026-11-01): 빅픽처 이동 중 PRoot 23% -> 8%,
+ * 정지 -78%, "Broken pipe" 줄 없음, 게임 실행됨. PROOT_FULL_CLOSE가 있으면 예전처럼 close를 전부 추적함
+ */
+static bool close_by_fd(Sysnum sysnum, int flags)
+{
+	return sysnum == PR_close && flags == 0 && getenv("PROOT_FULL_CLOSE") == NULL;
+}
